,1.33,1.67,2,2.33,2.67,3,3.33,3.67]},{\\"template\\":{\\"actions\\":[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on money-related difficulty is at the highest possible response value. Note where this appears and where your experience differs; this is not a clinical threshold.\\",\\"Notice which money-related situations feel difficult; describe practical facts separately from worries.\\"],\\"answerBands\\":[],\\"bands\\":[],\\"basis\\":\\"descriptive\\",\\"code\\":\\"continuous\\",\\"construct\\":\\"Money-related difficulty\\",\\"continuous\\":true,\\"currentAnswerBand\\":null,\\"currentBand\\":null,\\"label\\":\\"Descriptive score (0–4)\\",\\"limitations\\":[\\"No verified categorical cutoffs are applied to this version here. The score is not a diagnosis, norm or percentile.\\",\\"This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"],\\"meaning\\":\\"Money-related difficulty: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect stronger or more frequent responses about money-related difficulty during the questionnaire’s reference period. The total does not explain causes or by itself establish clinical severity. Mean of 3 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\",\\"presentationDirection\\":\\"difficulty\\",\\"recommendedReview\\":false,\\"reliableDirection\\":true,\\"source\\":null,\\"summary\\":\\"Higher scores reflect stronger or more frequent responses about money-related difficulty during the questionnaire’s reference period. The total does not explain causes or by itself establish clinical severity.\\",\\"verified\\":true},\\"values\\":[4]}]","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"resources\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"resources.money_pressure.coping\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Available money-related coping\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-7-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on available money-related coping is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Available money-related coping” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice which of the three coping responses is available and which is harder to access. These answers do not measure income, assets or financial competence.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","[\\"No verified categorical cutoffs are applied to this version here. The score is not a diagnosis, norm or percentile.\\",\\"This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"]","\\"Available money-related coping: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about available money