ve_self_concept\\",\\"max\\":8,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"ITQ negative self concept\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"typical-patterns\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"symptoms\\",\\"direction\\":\\"non-normative\\",\\"key\\":\\"symptoms.itq.disturbed_relationships\\",\\"max\\":8,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"ITQ disturbed relationships\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"typical-patterns\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","{\\"assessmentVersionId\\":\\"f2cfbc16-58ea-59fb-806c-530c098a9de8\\",\\"contentHash\\":\\"sha256:edd79b107e8d17568534c1226df5dd6cf4360c25ba9749f763ae7605f20840e9\\",\\"definitionKey\\":\\"itq-adult\\",\\"definitionVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"instrumentLocale\\":\\"en\\",\\"resultVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"scoringKey\\":\\"itq-adult-trauma\\",\\"scoringVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"translationVersion\\":\\"original-en-2026-source-pin\\"}","{\\"masterSha256\\":\\"c056fcf2a438787f145242e2009c2d8d4806fd0f7fd15e6d9093f243c79886cf\\",\\"minimumAge\\":18,\\"missingResponsePolicy\\":\\"null is unanswered, never zero; require complete applicable inputs; no imputation/prorating. Incomplete result is unavailable, not a negative screen. This is product handling, not a claimed validated manual missingness rule.\\",\\"nonDiagnostic\\":true,\\"permission\\":\\"Explicit public-domain declaration; no noncommercial-only restriction in cited official declaration. Commercial electronic reproduction is an inference from public-domain status, not endorsement of HH.\\",\\"permissionUrl\\":\\"https://www.traumameasuresglobal.com/ptsd\\",\\"reviewedAt\\":\\"2026-10-14\\",\\"title\\":\\"ITQ\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/686e835a5683f56bbfc4c3a4/68b0694afb8eccbc37bb76c0_ITQ_English.docx\\"}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"symptoms\\",\\"direction\\":\\"lower-reported-symptom-burden\\",\\"displayKind\\":\\"screening-count\\",\\"key\\":\\"symptoms.asrs6.shaded_count\\",\\"max\\":6,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"ASRS-v1.1 shaded-response count\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-6-months\\",\\"unit\\":\\"qualifying-responses\\"}","[\\"At {{value}} (0–6), the category is Below the screening threshold. Compare it with everyday functioning. This result does not rule out a problem; discuss concerning symptoms with a professional if needed.\\",\\"Consider noting concrete examples of attention or activity difficulties and their effect on daily life to discuss with a qualified healthcare professional.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"below_screen\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"Below the screening threshold\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":3},{\\"code\\":\\"screen_signal\\",\\"from\\":4,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"At or above the screening threshold\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":6}]","{\\"code\\":\\"below_screen\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"Below the screening threshold\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":3}","[\\"The published range belongs to this instrument; it does not establish a diagnosis, cause or probability of a condition.\\"]","\\"The result is below the screening threshold but does not rule out ADHD. This is not a diagnosis or severity rating. Discuss concerning symptoms with a qualified professional regardless of the score.\\"","[\\"At {{value}} (0–6), the category is At or above the screening threshold. Discuss symptoms and their effect on daily life with a qualified professional; the questionnaire does not determine a diagnosis or treatment.\\",\\"Consider noting concrete examples of attention or activity difficulties and their effect on daily life to discuss with a qualified healthcare professional.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"screen_signal\\",\\"from\\":4,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"At or above the screening threshold\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":6}","\\"The result is at or above the screening threshold: symptoms may be consistent with adult ADHD. This is not a diagnosis or severity rating. Discuss concerning symptoms with a qualified professional regardless of the score.\\"","{\\"assessmentVersionId\\":\\"7d84b0f8-027a-5992-a752-27133aa897ea\\",\\"contentHash\\":\\"sha256:3f2648c2008ae7436ab04fa28ce329f66d44960b7f1ca486ea5fdb814a872b04\\",\\"definitionKey\\":\\"asrs-6\\",\\"definitionVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"instrumentLocale\\":\\"en\\",\\"resultVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"scoringKey\\":\\"asrs-v1-6-classic\\",\\"scoringVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"translationVersion\\":\\"nyu-patient-en-v1\\"}","{\\"citation\\":\\"Kessler RC et al. (2005). The World Health Organization Adult ADHD Self-Report Scale (ASRS): a short screening scale for use in the general population. Psychological Medicine 35(2):245–256. doi:10.1017/S0033291704002892.\\",\\"formVersion\\":\\"ASRS-v1.1 6Q, patient-facing shaded form; not ASRS-5 or the full 18Q\\",\\"languageNote\\":\\"Original English patient-facing ASRS-v1.1 6Q. Published validation is sample-specific and does not establish a diagnosis.\\",\\"masterFilename\\":\\"6Q_ASRS_ENGLISH_final.pdf\\",\\"masterSha256\\":\\"3383491ecbbd65beb79b97c86a49e72fac8a5fdf8c40d94bfe58ed9189bdfee4\\",\\"minimumAge\\":18,\\"missingResponsePolicy\\":\\"Require all six valid answers. This is an HH implementation guardrail; no official prorating/imputation rule was located. Never convert missing to zero.\\",\\"nonDiagnostic\\":true,\\"permission\\":\\"NYU permits clinical, nonclinical and commercial use with attribution. Electronic reproduction is permitted; no other modifications are permitted. Not public domain.\\",\\"permissionUrl\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"population\\":\\"Adults aged 18 or older\\",\\"questionnairePage\\":2,\\"reviewedAt\\":\\"2026-10-12\\",\\"scoringUrl\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"sourceExtractionSha256\\":\\"a7fa800ddfeee5e4bc33e1d4cf2e5c029c91ba214d56c7a1a79bafb7bd88d8cf\\",\\"title\\":\\"New York University — ASRS-v1.1 6-Question Screener, patient-facing English original\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"validationLimitations\\":\\"Screening is not diagnosis. Exact-version Russian validation is unverified. No probabilities, severity bands, norms or treatment conclusions are assigned. The 2024 continuous 0–24 scoring and ASRS-5 are not used.\\",\\"validationSources\\":[\\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15841682/\\",\\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17623385/\\"]}","[\\"Результат {{value}} (0–6), категория «Ниже скринингового порога»: сопоставьте его с повседневным самочувствием. Даже этот результат не исключает проблему; беспокоящие симптомы можно обсудить со специалистом.\\",\\"Можно записать конкретные примеры трудностей с вниманием или активностью и их влияние на повседневную жизнь для обсуждения с квалифицированным медицинским специалистом.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"below_screen\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"Ниже скринингового порога\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":3},{\\"code\\":\\"screen_signal\\",\\"from\\":4,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"На уровне или выше скринингового порога\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":6}]","{\\"code\\":\\"below_screen\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"Ниже скринингового порога\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":3}","[\\"Опубликованный диапазон относится к этому инструменту и не устанавливает диагноз, причину или вероятность заболевания.\\",\\"Вопросы были на английском. Русский текст пояснения не является валидированной русской адаптацией опросника.\\"]","\\"Результат ниже скринингового порога, но не исключает СДВГ. Это не диагноз или оценка тяжести. Беспокоящие симптомы можно обсудить с квалифицированным специалистом независимо от балла.\\"","[\\"Результат {{value}} (0–6), категория «На уровне или выше скринингового порога»: обсудите симптомы и влияние на обычные дела с квалифицированным специалистом; опросник не определяет диагноз или лечение.\\",\\"Можно записать конкретные примеры трудностей с вниманием или активностью и их влияние на повседневную жизнь для обсуждения с квалифицированным медицинским специалистом.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"screen_signal\\",\\"from\\":4,\\"includeFrom\\":true,\\"includeTo\\":true,\\"label\\":\\"На уровне или выше скринингового порога\\",\\"source\\":\\"https://license.tov.med.nyu.edu/product/asrs6Qscreener\\",\\"to\\":6}","\\"Результат на уровне или выше скринингового порога: симптомы могут соответствовать СДВГ у взрослых. Это не диагноз или оценка тяжести. Беспокоящие симптомы можно обсудить с квалифицированным специалистом независимо от балла.\\"","{\\"assessmentVersionId\\":\\"132782f6-fe16-5d66-956c-ea47596f085a\\",\\"contentHash\\":\\"sha256:b64274437777684e0aea0150493adb4eb6015f9fd06bfbeb8b0b98998a67b387\\",\\"definitionKey\\":\\"asrs-6\\",\\"definitionVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"instrumentLocale\\":\\"ru\\",\\"resultVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"scoringKey\\":\\"asrs-v1-6-classic\\",\\"scoringVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"translationVersion\\":\\"nyu-patient-ru-v1\\"}","{\\"citation\\":\\"Kessler RC et al. (2005). The World Health Organization Adult ADHD Self-Report Scale (ASRS): a short screening scale for use in the general population. Psychological Medicine 35(2):245–256. doi:10.1017/S0033291704002892.\\",\\"formVersion\\":\\"ASRS-v1.1 6Q, patient-facing shaded form; not ASRS-5 or the full 18Q\\",\\"languageNote\\":\\"Official Russian translation distributed by NYU. Exact-version Russian validation was not established. Do not attach the performance figures of the differently worded 2026 Russian validation