playRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Вечернее приземление» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Придумайте небольшой вечерний переход, обозначающий завершение дел.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"function\\",\\"direction\\":\\"lower-reported-difficulty\\",\\"key\\":\\"function.decision_fog.overall\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Decision Fog\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"right-now\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[{\\"template\\":{\\"actions\\":[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on reported difficulty making and closing decisions is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Break one pending decision into facts, uncertainties and one reversible first step.\\"],\\"answerBands\\":[],\\"bands\\":[],\\"basis\\":\\"descriptive\\",\\"code\\":\\"continuous\\",\\"construct\\":\\"Reported difficulty making and closing decisions\\",\\"continuous\\":true,\\"currentAnswerBand\\":null,\\"currentBand\\":null,\\"label\\":\\"Descriptive score (0–4)\\",\\"limitations\\":[\\"No verified categorical cutoffs are applied to this version here. The score is not a diagnosis, norm or percentile.\\",\\"This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"],\\"meaning\\":\\"Reported difficulty making and closing decisions: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect stronger or more frequent responses about reported difficulty making and closing decisions during the questionnaire’s reference period. The total does not explain causes or by itself establish clinical severity. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an ori