ажать.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Компас близости» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Уточните одну комфортную форму близости и одну границу, которую важно уважать.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"resources\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"resources.confidence_pulse.overall\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Confidence Pulse\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"right-now\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on trust in everyday choices and coping is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Trust in everyday choices and coping: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about trust in everyday choices and coping. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about trust in everyday choices and coping. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on trust in everyday choices and coping as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. Compare only the same version, questionnaire language and reference period.\\",\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":1.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\\",\\"to\\":2.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Confidence Pulse” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Recall one manageable action you completed and a new small action you would willingly attempt.\