” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one situation where your body feels at ease and identify an optional grounding action.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Feeling Safe in My Body” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one situation where your body feels at ease and identify an optional grounding action.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Feeling Safe in My Body” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one situation where your body feels at ease and identify an optional grounding action.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Noticing bodily comfort and choosing grounding: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about noticing bodily comfort and choosing grounding. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about noticing bodily comfort and choosing grounding. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on noticing bodily comfort and choosing