 контакта.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Принадлежность и связь» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Найдите круг или человека, с которым можно быть собой, и один безопасный способ контакта.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"function\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"function.conflict_repair.overall\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"After a Difficult Conversation\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-7-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on pausing, dialogue and choice after conflict is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\