ence, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about pausing, dialogue and choice after conflict. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on pausing, dialogue and choice after conflict as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. Compare only the same version, questionnaire language and reference period.\\",\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":1.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":2.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “After a Difficult Conversation” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\",\\"to\\":4}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on pausing, dialogue and choice after conflict is at the highest possible response value. Note where this appears and where your experience differs; this is not a clinical threshold.\\",\\"Reflect on one difficult conversation: what mattered to you and what a safe repair could look like.\\"]","{\\"assessmentVersionId\\":\\"aee0184b-a4b3-5d0c-a871-c2f2f3faf2d3\\",\\"contentHash\\":\\"sha256:81431d3e392eaa5462dcd8c1b2c6a7de93e31bdaa46487c031766318e74117e5\\",\\"definitionKey\\":\\"hh-conflict-repair\\",\\"definitionVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"instrumentLocale\\":\\"en\\",\\"resultVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"scoringKey\\":\\"configured\\",\\"scoringVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"translationVersion\\":\\"hh-en-v1\\"}","{\\"reviewedAt\\":\\"2026-10-08\\",\\"status\\":\\"original-playful-non-diagnostic-reflection\\",\\"title\\":\\"Holistic House — After a Difficult Conversation\\"}","[\\"Результат {{value}} (0–4) по теме «Пауза, диалог и свобода выбора после конфликта» на нижней границе возможных ответов. Проверьте, соответствует ли это вашему опыту, и отметьте исключения, которые общий балл не показывает.\\",\\"Подумайте об одном трудном разговоре: что было важно и как могло бы выглядеть безопасное восстановление контакта.\\