"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Семейные роли и мой выбор» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Отметьте привычную семейную роль и самостоятельный взрослый выбор, доступный сегодня.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"resources\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"resources.inner_imagery.overall\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Imagination & Inner Images\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-7-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on voluntary use of imagination and metaphor is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Voluntary use of imagination and metaphor: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about voluntary use of imagination and metaphor. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about voluntary use of imagination and metaphor. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on voluntary use of imagination and metaphor as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. Compare only the same version, questionnaire language and reference period.\\",\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":1.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":2.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Imagination & Inner Images” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\",\\"to\\":4}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on voluntary use of imagination and metaphor is at the highest possible response value. Note where this appears and where your experience differs; this is not a clinical threshold.\\",\\"If imagination feels comfortable, describe one calming image; stop if imagery feels distressing.\\"]","{\\"assessmentVersionId\\":\\"5ebfbbb4-8ce5-58b9-a5bc-dfe8cdc1bfb4\\",\\"contentHash\\":\\"sha256:d36b08688ba6637c3eec663e09a1419506a5038bb5b8a0db34d2d70eb6c3a73e\\",\\"definitionKey\\":\\"hh-inner-imagery\\",\\"definitionVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"instrumentLocale\\":\\"en\\",\\"resultVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"scoringKey\\":\\"configured\\",\\"scoringVersion\\":\\"v1\\",\\"translationVersion\\":\\"hh-en-v1\\"}","{\\"reviewedAt\\":\\"2026-10-08\\",\\"status\\":\\"original-playful-non-diagnostic-reflection\\",\\"title\\":\\"Holistic House — Imagination & Inner Images\\"}","[\\"Результат {{value}} (0–4) по теме «Добровольное использование воображения и метафор» на нижней границе возможных ответов. Проверьте, соответствует ли это вашему опыту, и отметьте исключения, которые общий балл не показывает.\\",\\"Если воображать комфортно, опишите спокойный образ; прекратите, если это неприятно.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Почти не отмечается\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Доброволь