, когда это всё же становится доступно.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Назовите одно реальное препятствие и более маленький первый шаг в зоне контроля.\\",\\"to\\":1.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Отчасти\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Зависит от ситуации\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Препятствия на пути к цели» проявляется по-разному. Сопоставьте, в каких обстоятельствах это ощущается легче, а в каких сложнее.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Назовите одно реальное препятствие и более маленький первый шаг в зоне контроля.\\",\\"to\\":2.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"В значительной степени\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается часто\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Препятствия на пути к цели» отмечается часто. Условия, усталость и стресс могут влиять на это; постоянства не требуется.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Назовите одно реальное препятствие и более маленький первый шаг в зоне контроля.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Препятствия на пути к цели» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Назовите одно реальное препятствие и более маленький первый шаг в зоне контроля.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"state\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"state.body_mind_context.overall\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Body–Mind Context Notes\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-7-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on observing bodily sensations without assuming causes is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Body–Mind Context Notes” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Observing bodily sensations without assuming causes: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about observing bodily sensations without assuming causes. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 6 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about observing bodily sensations without assuming causes. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on observing bodily sensations without assuming causes as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. Compare only the same version, questionnaire language and reference period.\\",\\"Observe context, body sensations and concern as separate observations; do not assume a psychological cause.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"di