обязательно.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"resources\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"resources.trust_dialogue.honesty\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Speaking honestly\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-30-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on speaking honestly is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Speaking honestly: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about speaking honestly. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 3 responses. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here. This is an original Holistic House self-reflection questionnaire. Its score must not be treated as a validated clinical assessment or evidence that an intervention works.\\"","\\"Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about speaking honestly. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses.\\"","[\\"Use {{value}} (0–4) on speaking honestly as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. Compare only the same version, questionnaire language and reference period.\\",\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\"]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":1.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":2.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusatory sentence about what you need, and choose whether sharing it feels safe.\\",\\"to\\":3.5}","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Speaking honestly” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Write one honest, non-accusato