\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Очень сильно\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Отмечается устойчиво\\",\\"note\\":\\"В этих ответах «Присутствие и автономия» отмечается устойчиво. Это не духовный уровень и не гарантия во всех ситуациях; выбор и границы остаются важными.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Выберите привычный контакт и попробуйте короткую паузу перед ответом; для близости не нужно отказываться от границ.\\",\\"to\\":4}","{\\"dimensionClass\\":\\"resources\\",\\"direction\\":\\"higher-reported-resource\\",\\"key\\":\\"resources.sensual_joy.senses\\",\\"max\\":4,\\"min\\":0,\\"sourceConstruct\\":\\"Comfortable sensations\\",\\"timeframe\\":\\"past-30-days\\",\\"unit\\":\\"points\\"}","[\\"Your {{value}} (0–4) on comfortable sensations is at the lowest possible response value. Check whether that fits your experience and note exceptions the aggregate cannot show.\\",\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\"]","[{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":0.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-1\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0.5–<1.5\\",\\"from\\":0.5,\\"label\\":\\"A little\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Occasionally reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” is reported occasionally. Notice safe situations in which it becomes available.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":1.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-2\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"1.5–<2.5\\",\\"from\\":1.5,\\"label\\":\\"Somewhat\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Depends on context\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” varies by context. Compare situations where it feels easier with those where it feels harder.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":2.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-3\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"2.5–<3.5\\",\\"from\\":2.5,\\"label\\":\\"Quite a lot\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Often reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” is often reported. Conditions, fatigue and stress can still make it variable; consistency is not required.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":3.5},{\\"code\\":\\"answer-4\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"3.5–4\\",\\"from\\":3.5,\\"label\\":\\"Very much\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Consistently reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” is consistently reported. This is not a spiritual rank or a promise about every situation; choice and boundaries still matter.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":4}]","{\\"code\\":\\"answer-0\\",\\"displayRange\\":\\"0–<0.5\\",\\"from\\":0,\\"label\\":\\"Not at all\\",\\"levelLabel\\":\\"Rarely reported\\",\\"note\\":\\"In these answers, “Comfortable sensations” is seldom reported. That is not a defect or diagnosis; explore the theme without pressure.\\",\\"optionalPractice\\":\\"Notice one pleasant everyday sensory detail for thirty seconds, such as music or a warm drink, if comfortable.\\",\\"to\\":0.5}","\\"Comfortable sensations: {{value}} (0–4). Higher scores reflect greater endorsement of the statements about comfortable sensations. This describes reported experience, not personal worth; an aggregate can hide differences between responses. Mean of 3 responses. No verified 