. Self-reports do not diagnose a condition or establish its cause.\\",\\"presentationDirection\\":\\"difficulty\\",\\"recommendedReview\\":false,\\"reliableDirection\\":true,\\"source\\":",289,",\\"summary\\":\\"Your score falls within the published 5–9 point range (screening category): low reported somatic symptom severity. Self-reports do not diagnose a condition or establish its cause.\\",\\"verified\\":true},\\"values\\":[5,6,7,8,9]},{\\"template\\":{\\"actions\\":[\\"At {{value}} (0–30), the category is medium reported somatic symptom severity. Compare it with everyday functioning. This result does not rule out a problem; discuss concerning symptoms with a professional if needed.\\",",982,"],\\"answerBands\\":[],\\"bands\\":",983,",\\"basis\\":\\"screening\\",\\"code\\":\\"medium\\",\\"construct\\":\\"Reported bodily symptom burden\\",\\"continuous\\":false,\\"currentAnswerBand\\":null,\\"currentBand\\":",985,",\\"label\\":\\"medium reported somatic symptom severity\\",\\"limitations\\":",182,",\\"meaning\\":\\"Reported bodily symptom burden: {{value}} (0–30). Your score falls within the published 10–14 point range (screening category): medium reported somatic symptom severity. Self-reports do not diagnose a condition or establish its cause.\\",\\"presentationDirection\\":\\"difficulty\\",\\"recommendedReview\\":false,\\"reliableDirection\\":true,\\"source\\":",289,",\\"summary\\":\\"Your score falls within the published 10–14 point range (screening category): medium reported somatic symptom severity. Self-reports do not diagnose a condition or establish its cause.\\",\\"verified\\":true},\\"values\\":[10,11,12,13,14]},{\\"template\\":{\\"actions\\":[\\"At {{value}} (0–30), the category is high reported symptom burden. Discuss symptoms and their effect on daily life with a qualified professional; the questionnaire does not determine a diagnosis or treatment.\\",",982,"],\\"answerBands\\":[],\\"bands\\":",983,",\\"basis\\":\\"screening\\",\\"code\\":\\"high\\",\